translate japanese story_route_ds_97fc87e43d5d_1:
    voice voice_file("v_e9e2343c059f")
    ds "初めて会った時のこと、まだ覚えてる？"

translate japanese story_route_ds_3bc23ad5109b_2:
    voice voice_file("v_c9874004f4cf")
    u "もちろん"

translate japanese story_route_ds_7d2f22014eaf_1:
    voice voice_file("v_2d4b02d44fea")
    ds "あの時、私のこと、すっごくばかだと思った？"

translate japanese story_route_ds_88c9b8aa98f4_11:
    voice voice_file("v_594c8fa1c99d")
    u "ああ"

translate japanese story_route_ds_05cb0c12992e_1:
